# Never commit extracted game data, warehouse copies, or archive keys.
# Patterns are deliberately broad: a key committed once stays in history forever.
/data/
/warehouse/
/tmp-probe/
aes.txt
aes*.key
*.key
*.pem
secrets.properties
*.local.json
